    {
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "victoria-metrics"
      },
      "description": "Nearly all of these are idle: application pools hold their connections open between queries, so this reflects pool sizing far more than it reflects load. 'idle in transaction' is the one to watch -- those hold locks and snapshots while doing nothing.",
